      "message": "Take a look when you can! I have some commented-out progress for including texture \u0026 color - I may continue that work on a separate branch, but wanted to get some of your preliminary thoughts. Let me know if you want me to delete that in the interim.\n\nAs a note, I am now using a raw SkVertices pointer within Geometry\u0027s union. Gregand I had a conversation about how the sk_sp wrapper is not well-suited to be used within a union data type. Whenever the sk_sp gets assigned (even to a nullptr), it will check if the prior pointer is null. If it is not, then it will unref the prior pointer. The problem with this is that within the union, the sk_sp seems to get initialized as a \"wild pointer\", or may still have a non-null pointer to deleted information. This leads to seg faults.",
